{"sha": "a0ea4f163ae92fcee2d7a7a98d416dc0fb8edef7bdeb0e43c5fcca9bcd4d0edf", "body": ["\\chapter{函数}\\label{ch:g10:functions}", "", "函数是一台机器，接收一个数，输出一个数，", "对同一输入总是给出相同的输出。函数是你今后几年要学习的", "分析学的核心对象", "（自\\cref{ch:g11:quad}起）；本章建立基本词汇 ---", "定义域、像、图像、变化情况 --- 并训练", "从图像中读取信息的基本技能。", "", "\\section{词汇：像与原像}", "", "\\begin{definition}[函数]\\label{def:g10:functions:function}", "设 $D$ 为实数集，\\emph{函数}\\index{函数} $f$ 为定义在", "$D$ 上的对应规则，对每个 $x \\in D$，恰好对应一个实数，", "记为 $f(x)$，称为 $x$ 的\\emph{像}\\index{像}。", "集合 $D$ 称为\\emph{定义域}\\index{定义域}，即 $f$ 的定义域。记为", "\\[", "f : x \\longmapsto f(x).", "\\]", "若 $f(x) = y$，则 $x$ 是\\emph{原像}\\index{原像}，其像为 $y$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "定义域中每个 $x$ 恰有一个像，但一个数 $y$ 可以有", "若干个原像，也可以没有原像。对 $f(x) = x^2$，$3$ 的像是 $9$，而", "$9$ 有两个原像，即 $3$ 与 $-3$；数 $-4$ 没有原像。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[求定义域]\\label{ex:g10:functions:domain}", "当函数由一个式子给出时，其定义域是使该式有意义的全体 $x$ 构成的", "集合。", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item $f(x) = 3x^2 - 5x + 1$ 对每个 $x$ 都有意义，定义域为", "        $\\R$.", "  \\item $g(x) = \\dfrac{1}{x - 2}$ 要求 $x - 2 \\neq 0$，定义域为", "        除 $2$ 外的全体实数。", "  \\item $h(x) = \\sqrt{x - 3}$ 要求 $x - 3 \\geq 0$，定义域为", "        $\\intco{3}{+\\infty}$.", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[计算像与原像]\\label{ex:g10:functions:images}", "设 $f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 3$，定义在 $\\R$ 上。", "", "\\emph{$5$ 的像：}代入 $x = 5$：", "$f(5) = 25 - 20 + 3 = 8$.", "", "\\emph{$3$ 的原像：}解方程 $f(x) = 3$：", "\\[", "x^2 - 4x + 3 = 3", "\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad", "x^2 - 4x = 0", "\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad", "x(x - 4) = 0,", "\\]", "故 $3$ 的原像为 $0$ 与 $4$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{函数的图像}", "", "\\begin{definition}[图像]\\label{def:g10:functions:graph}", "在坐标系中，\\emph{图像}\\index{图像}（或\\emph{曲线}）是", "$f$ 的全体点 $(x, f(x))$（$x$ 取遍定义域）组成的集合。", "换言之，点 $(x, y)$ 在图像上，当且仅当 $y = f(x)$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.6cm, height=6.0cm,", "  xmin=-2.6, xmax=4.6, ymin=-3.4, ymax=4.4,", "  xtick={-2,-1,1,2,3,4}, ytick={-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-2.2:4.2, samples=120]", "    {0.25*x^3 - 0.75*x^2 - x + 2};", "  \\draw[dashed, omThm] (axis cs:3,0) -- (axis cs:3,-1)", "    -- (axis cs:0,-1);", "  \\fill[omThm] (axis cs:3,-1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, below right] at (axis cs:3,-1.05)", "    {$(3,\\,f(3))$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 在图像上读取像：从横轴上 $x = 3$ 出发，", "竖直移动到曲线上，再水平移动到纵轴，", "读出 $f(3) = -1$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[读图方法]\\label{met:g10:functions:reading}", "在 $f$ 的图像上：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{$a$ 的像}：从横轴上 $x = a$ 处", "        竖直走到曲线，再水平走到纵轴，读得的值", "        即为 $f(a)$；", "  \\item \\emph{$b$ 的原像}：画出水平直线 $y = b$，", "        原像是该直线与曲线全部交点的 $x$", "        坐标；", "  \\item \\emph{方程 $f(x) = k$ 的解}：与 $k$ 的原像相同；", "  \\item \\emph{不等式 $f(x) \\leq k$ 的解}：所有 $x$，使", "        曲线位于直线 $y = k$ 上或其下方。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.6cm, height=6.0cm,", "  xmin=-3.4, xmax=3.4, ymin=-2.4, ymax=4.4,", "  xtick={-2,2}, xticklabels={$x_1$,$x_2$}, ytick={2}, yticklabels={$k$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-3:3, samples=120] {0.5*x^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=-3.2:3.2] {2};", "  \\fill (axis cs:-2,2) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,2) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[dashed] (axis cs:-2,2) -- (axis cs:-2,0);", "  \\draw[dashed] (axis cs:2,2) -- (axis cs:2,0);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}